Push repository secrets declared in workspace.yaml

Usage:
  orbit ci secrets [command]

Available Commands:
  sync        Set every ci_secrets entry for one repo, or every repo that declares any

Flags:
  -h, --help              help for secrets
      --manifest string   Path to workspace.yaml

Global Flags:
      --config string   Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file

Use "orbit ci secrets [command] --help" for more information about a command.
